hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2889","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Abu Ahmad, who said: Narrated to us Sufyan, from Abdur-Rahman bin Al-Harith bin Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'ah, from Zaid bin Ali, from his father, from Abdullah bin Abi Rafi', from Ali bin Abi Talib (RA), who said: ""Then the Prophet (ﷺ) came to the Jamrah and stoned it. Then he came to the place of slaughter (Al-Manhar"
